  "notes": [
    "A safety-critical artefact, versioned like the corpus. A wrong risk tag",
    "either misses a disclosure or makes the system panic at a normal question.",
    "Seeded from authentic phrasing in evaluation/datasets language cases,",
    "written by a Kenyan reviewer. Terms invented by a model do not belong here.",
    "Scope is deliberately narrow: the four content domains plus the vocabulary",
    "of harm. This is not a general Sheng dictionary and should not become one.",
    "risk_tags raise scrutiny. They do not by themselves prove a disclosure -",
    "'kudedi' means to die and is almost always idiom."
  ],

